<title>THAILAND: Ayudhya Jardine 1996 net turns to loss.</title>
<headline>Ayudhya Jardine 1996 net turns to loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss     31.69	vs  Profit   5.90</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss    633.85	vs  Profit  92.62</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Ayudhya Jardine CMG Life Insruance Plc, an insurance firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
